ision `CAT-01-01` says the same.\n\n**Now:** I ran `./gradlew test-e2e --rerun --tests \"*SeededCatalogE2ETest*\"` and the build succeeded. The test is still unchanged, as it should be for an adopted story.\n\n**What I changed:** only `tasks/CAT-01/tests.md`.\n- I removed the `## needs-human` section, since the decision is answered.\n- I rewrote the note on the e2e test to say what caused the first failure, how it was resolved, and that the test now passes.\n\nThe criterion table, the four characterization tests and their break patches are as they were. I didn't touch production code, other tests or build files, and I didn't run the gate again or any other stage. The gate's `files-listed` line about the patches was only a note, not a failure, so I left it alone.","ttft_ms":2165,"type":"result","duration_ms":48052,"uuid":"7d369fc5-40e8-4727-a07d-669c60d19784","ttft_stream_ms":1547,"time_to_request_ms":38,"first_content_frame_ms":1547,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
